{"c":{"144683":["Saltherine Aldarake","Female","b144683-qOUiweknRTBd.png","Saltherine Aldarake, or Sally, is a bright, cheerful princess who wants to go on an adventure because she is bored of her tiny little castle in the countryside. Sally has a kind-hearted spirit who craves for adventure.",153],"145480":["Frau","Female","b145480-tr3D6T6Z1EPL.png","A demi-human rabbit.",119],"183792":["Mikoto Kibitsu","Male","b183792-KfjVH9BJic55.png","He has come to the Western Continent to kill any and all Oni that he encounters. He travels with a dog and a Oni named Millia.",116],"208337":["Hawthorn","Male","b208337-WYbmCWwLmkkX.png","",27],"208338":["Carrot","Female","b208338-EvPrDHPOEj6G.jpg","Carrot is one of the characters in the Peach Boy Riverside series. She is a High Oni who was previously known as Meki that joins Sally on her travels after losing her powers. She is an Oni from the east.",111],"208339":["Dog",null,"b208339-ihQlmatwyyuT.png","",16],"216142":["Winnie Emex","Female","b216142-f5Grj2DGXdQD.png","Winnie, also known as Winnie the Witch, is a witch owning a bar nearby the Rimdarl Kingdom.",83],"226512":["Todoroki","Male","b226512-6ebUcF3DQkuE.png","",4],"226513":["Juselino","Female","b226513-YnkJmyqtW4nw.jpg","",24],"226514":["Millia","Female","b226514-2scsJQyzNDIY.png","Millia, also known as Hatsuki, is a Middle Oni that is capable of controlling her hair.",22],"226515":["Atra","Female","b226515-uCuvqZ47dn6m.png","",11],"226516":["Sumeragi","Male","b226516-vVxuexjQqjm2.png","",5],"238829":["Sett","Male","b238829-hlhkP6FmAfGE.jpg","Sett looks like a large humanoid walrus. He has two long tusks and one big black Oni horn on top of his head.",0],"256946":["Berett","Male","b256946-0jowbyWhEvSi.png","",1],"256958":["Aldarake Kokuo","Male","default.jpg","Sally's father and king.",0],"256959":["Jii oni",null,"default.jpg","",0],"256960":["Mou oni",null,"default.jpg","",0],"256961":["Bakery Tenshu",null,"default.jpg","",0],"256962":["Bakery Tenin",null,"default.jpg",